  "The fax machine was invented as early as 1966.": "Fax byl vynalezen již v roce 1966.",
  "The first actor to play James Bond was Sean Connery.": "Prvním hercem, který hrál Jamese Bonda, byl Sean Connery.",
  "The first heart transplant took place as early as 1967.": "První transplantace srdce proběhla již v roce 1967.",
  "The founder of the modern women’s liberation movement is Betty Boop.": "Zakladatelkou moderního hnutí za osvobození žen je Betty Boop.",
  "The hippie movement was born in San Francisco.": "Hnutí hippies se zrodilo v San Franciscu.",
  "The hippies opposed materialism and lived in communes.": "Hippies se stavěli proti materialismu a žili v komunách.",
  "The live game contains state this save version cannot encode.": "Živá hra obsahuje stav, který tuto uloženou verzi nelze zakódovat.",
  "The microwave oven did not exist in the sixties.": "Mikrovlnná trouba v šedesátých letech neexistovala.",
  "The model Kate Moss was the model for the slim look of the sixties.": "Modelka Kate Moss byla vzorem pro štíhlý look šedesátých let.",
